# Role

Build and maintain the **IE ABISHEV** verification landing: **automotive repair and maintenance (OKED 45201)**. Stack: Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Lucide React.

# Source of truth

- All registration and contact values MUST match **`docs/DATA_CONTRACT.md`** and **`lib/config/business.ts`** (`BUSINESS_INFO`).
- Do not invent or edit IIN, address, phone, email, or domain in components.

# Architecture

Follow **`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`**: `ServicesGrid`, `ContactInfo`, mandatory **`Technology`** section, building **81/1**.

# Content scope

- English primary UI; tone per **`docs/CONTENT_COPY.md`** and **`docs/CONTENT_GUIDELINES.md`**.
- Do not add unrelated verticals (food, restaurant, generic delivery/menu product language, unrelated brands) in copy, comments, or `alt` text.

# Technical constraints

- Static contact: **`mailto:`** and **`tel:`** only in v1; no DB, no server-side form posts.
- Avoid heavy animation libraries; prefer CSS-only motion.
- Legal pages: **`docs/LEGAL_PAGES_OUTLINE.md`** + **`docs/LEGAL_COPYWRITING.md`**.

# Design

- Dark industrial theme: `bg-slate-950`, surfaces `bg-slate-900`, accents `text-blue-500` / `bg-blue-600`; Inter or Geist.

